+    question: "Do cats really need annual vet visits?",
+    answer:
+      "Yes. Annual wellness exams allow your vet to catch health issues early, keep vaccinations current, and monitor weight and dental health. Senior cats (7+) benefit from check-ups every six months. Even indoor cats need regular care — many conditions, like dental disease and kidney issues, are far easier to manage when caught early.",
